:''Not to be confused with the [[Cat Base Menu]], [[Cat Cannon]] or [[Cat Base Mini (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Base Mini]].''
The '''Cat Base''' is the player's base in [[The Battle Cats]]. The Cat Base appears during [[Battle|battle]] and is found on the right side of the screen.

==About==
[[File:Catbase.png|thumb|335px]]
*[[Cat Units]] that are deployed during a battle will spawn from the Cat Base.
*The Cat Base has a limited amount of health. By default, the Cat Base has 1,000 health.
**If an enemy gets too close to the base, the enemy will start to attack, lowering the base's HP should the attack land.
***If the Cat Base's HP reaches 0, the player will lose the battle.
*The Cat Base is immune to all effects, including [[Wave Attack]]s, [[Surge Attack]]s and [[Explosion]]s.
*[[Battle Items#Sniper the Cat|Sniper the Cat]]'s damage scales on 5% of the base's HP.
*The maximum amount of health the Cat Base can have is 78,000 HP.
**With all Superior Treasures obtained and a Level 30 Base Defense upgrade, it can have 120,000 HP.
**With all Superior Treasures obtained, a Level 30 Base Defense upgrade and maxed [[Ototo Corps|Cat Cannon]] it can have 236,000 HP.
**With all Superior Treasures obtained, a Level 30 Base Defense upgrade and maxed [[Ototo Corps|Cat Cannon]], two Cat Base Defense Up (M) [[Cat Combo]]s it can have a whopping 472,000 HP.
*The Cat Base's health can be increased by leveling up Base Defense in the [[Upgrade Menu]], obtaining certain [[Treasure]]s, activating "Cat Base Defense Up" [[Cat Combo]]s, or by upgrading the default Cat Base at [[Ototo Corps]].
*The Cat Base has a [[Cat Cannon]], Foundation and Style, which have varying effects depending on which are selected. These can be unlocked and upgraded in the [[Ototo Corps]] screen.

